#  Locust Max-RPS Stress Test — v∞++++ PATCHED EDITION
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  ✅ FIXES APPLIED (Based on Code Review):
#    1. Content-Length check now ignores compressed responses (gzip/br).
#    2. Empty body check ignores 204/205/HEAD/OPTIONS.
#    3. Auto-injects Content-Type: application/json for mutations.
#    4. Thundering Herd now has Cooldown, Rate-Limit, and Cache.
#    5. Fixed Race Condition on Connection header (passed as extra_headers).
#    6. Removed private environment attributes (using module-level state).
#    7. Isolated logging to prevent interference with Locust root logger.
#    8. Removed dead ENDPOINTS_STR variable.
#    9. Fixed stat_name generation for endpoints with existing query params.
#   10. Request exceptions now log as WARNING instead of DEBUG.
#   11. Unified strict/non-strict failure reporting (no more 3xx inconsistency).
#   12. IP Spoofing now excludes private/reserved ranges (10.x, 192.x, etc).
#   13. Clamped SPAWN_RATE * 2 in Pulse mode.
#   14. Added missing HEAVY_ENDPOINTS validation warnings.
#   15. Health check renamed to [startup] reachability.
#   16. ENV parsing fallbacks now log as WARNING instead of ERROR.
#
#  Locust compatibility: 2.x | Python: 3.8+
# =============================================================================

